    <unit id="4" name="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Stack related content sections that can expand or collapse independently.</source>
        <target state="translated">将相关内容组织成可独立展开和收起的面板。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="5" name="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Collapse organizes dense information into panels. It supports accordion behavior, nested panels, borderless and ghost styles, custom spacing, icon placement, and icon-only trigger mode.</source>
        <target state="translated">Collapse 用于把密集信息分组到多个面板中，支持手风琴、嵌套面板、无边框与幽灵样式、自定义间距、图标位置和仅图标触发展开。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="6" name="ScenarioBasic">
      <segment>
        <source>Basic</source>
        <target state="translated">基础</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="7" name="ScenarioAppearance">
      <segment>
        <source>Appearance</source>
        <target state="translated">外观</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="8" name="ScenarioBehavior">
      <segment>
        <source>Behavior</source>
        <target state="translated">行为</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="9" name="CollapseTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Collapse</source>
        <target state="translated">折叠面板</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="10" name="CollapseDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>By default, any number of panels can be expanded at a time. The first panel is expanded in this example.</source>
        <target state="translated">默认情况下，可以同时展开任意数量的面板。本示例中第一个面板处于展开状态。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="11" name="SizeTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Size</source>
        <target state="translated">尺寸</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="12" name="SizeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Ant Design supports a default collapse size as well as a large and small size. If a large or small collapse is desired, set the size property to either large or small respectively. Omit the size property for a collapse with the default size.</source>
        <target state="translated">Ant Design 支持默认、大号和小号三种折叠面板尺寸。需要大号或小号时分别设置 size 属性；省略 size 属性时使用默认尺寸。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="13" name="AccordionTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Accordion</source>
        <target state="translated">手风琴</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="14" name="AccordionDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>In accordion mode, only one panel can be expanded at a time.</source>
        <target state="translated">在手风琴模式下，同一时间只能展开一个面板。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="15" name="NestedPanelTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Nested panel</source>
        <target state="translated">嵌套面板</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="16" name="NestedPanelDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Collapse is nested inside the Collapse.</source>
        <target state="translated">在 Collapse 内嵌套 Collapse。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="17" name="BorderlessTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Borderless</source>
        <target state="translated">无边框</target>
